Error [E0408]: `err` is not available in an optional fallback
  --> tests/ui/refutable_test_bind_optional.jet:6:37
    |
  6 |     maybe() == .Val(value) ?? panic(err)
    |                                     ^^^
 Why: an optional can be absent, but it has no failure report to name
 Fix: remove `err`, or use a fallible result when the fallback needs the failure
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0408
